<title>INDIA: India's RBI sets repo cut-off at 4.80 percent.</title>
<headline>India's RBI sets repo cut-off at 4.80 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Tuesday said it set the cut-off at 4.80 percent in the three-day repo auction against 4.85 percent previously.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received five bids for 34.50 billion rupees of which it accepted four bids for 33 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off rate was 4.7727 percent, RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
